---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: St. Paul United Methodist Church — Fremont, CA
description: "Saint Paul United Methodist Church, Fremont CA. Inspiration, Incarnation, Intersection. Sunday worship 10:00 a.m. at 33350 Peace Terrace. All are welcome, and we mean that."
---
<!-- ========== HERO ========== -->
<div id="top"></div>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <img class="hero-logo" src="/images/uploads/saint-paul-logo.png" alt="Saint Paul United Methodist Church">
    <p class="welcome-line"><span>All are welcome, and we mean that.</span></p>
    <h1>Where Jesus' story becomes our story, and our story <em>engages the world</em>.</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">A multi-cultural, multi-generational family in Fremont, California — worshiping together since 1964. Come as you are, at 10:00 on Sunday morning.</p>

    <div class="facts">
      <div class="fact">
        <div class="k">Every Sunday</div>
        <div class="v">10:00 a.m.</div>
        <div class="n">Worship &amp; open communion</div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact">
        <div class="k">Find us</div>
        <div class="v"><a href="https://maps.google.com/maps?z=16&amp;q=33350+peace+terrace+fremont+ca+94555" target="_blank" rel="noopener">33350 Peace&nbsp;Terrace</a></div>
        <div class="n">Fremont, CA 94555</div>
      </div>
      <div class="fact">
        <div class="k">Church office</div>
        <div class="v"><a href="tel:15104293990">(510) 429-3990</a></div>
        <div class="n">welcome@belongatstpaul.org</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="btnrow">
      <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#first">Plan your first Sunday</a>
      <a class="btn btn-out" href="#ministries">Find your place</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== SEASONAL FEATURE(S) ========== -->
{%- if collections.seasonalFeature.length %}
<section class="reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Featured</p>
      <h2>This Season at Saint Paul</h2>
    </div>
    {%- for feature in collections.seasonalFeature %}
    {%- set photo = feature.templateContent | firstImage %}
    <div class="feature{% if not photo %} no-image{% endif %}"{% if not loop.last %} style="margin-bottom:2.6rem"{% endif %}>
      {%- if photo %}
      <img src="{{ photo.src }}" alt="{{ photo.alt }}">
      {%- endif %}
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.2vw,2.4rem);margin-bottom:.7rem">{{ feature.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ feature.data.summary }}</p>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem"><a class="btn btn-out" href="{{ feature.url }}">More details<span class="sr-only"> about {{ feature.data.title }}</span></a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<!-- ========== WELCOME BAND ========== -->
<section class="band" id="welcome">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Who this table is for</p>
        <h2>You don't have to belong first. <em>Come, and belong here.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Holy Communion is served every Sunday, and it is an open table. Anyone who seeks to respond to Christ's love is invited to partake — no membership, no paperwork, no waiting period.</p>
        <p>Filipino, Caucasian, Asian Indian, Ghanaian. Lifelong Methodists and people who haven't set foot in a church in twenty years. Toddlers who won't sit still and grandparents who've sat in the same pew since the sanctuary was built.</p>
        <p class="sig">The table is Christ's, not ours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ribbon" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ribbon-track">
      <span>Come as you are</span><span>Bring the kids</span><span>First Sunday, first time</span><span>Every age</span><span>Wear whatever you own</span><span>Questions welcome</span><span>No membership required</span><span>Sit anywhere</span><span>Loud toddlers</span><span>Sixty years of neighbors</span>
      <span>Come as you are</span><span>Bring the kids</span><span>First Sunday, first time</span><span>Every age</span><span>Wear whatever you own</span><span>Questions welcome</span><span>No membership required</span><span>Sit anywhere</span><span>Loud toddlers</span><span>Sixty years of neighbors</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== SIGNATURE: THE PATH OF THREE WORDS ========== -->
<div class="pathwrap">
  <nav class="wrap path" aria-label="Jump to Inspiration, Incarnation, or Intersection">
    <a class="path-node n1" href="#worship" data-target="worship">
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 18h6M10 21h4M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-3.5 10.9c.5.4.8 1 .8 1.6h5.4c0-.6.3-1.2.8-1.6A6 6 0 0 0 12 3Z"/></svg></span>
      <b>Inspiration</b>
    </a>
    <a class="path-node n2" href="#ministries" data-target="ministries">
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.4-7-9a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 11c0 4.6-7 9-7 9Z"/></svg></span>
      <b>Incarnation</b>
    </a>
    <a class="path-node n3" href="#outreach" data-target="outreach">
      <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="6.5" r="2.3"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="8.5" r="2"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="8.5" r="2"/><path d="M8.6 19v-4.6a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 6.8 0V19M2.6 19v-3.4A2.9 2.9 0 0 1 5.5 13M21.4 19v-3.4a2.9 2.9 0 0 0-2.9-2.6"/></svg></span>
      <b>Intersection</b>
    </a>
  </nav>
</div>

<!-- ========== THREE WORDS ========== -->
<section class="reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Three words we live by</p>
      <h2>Not a slogan. It's how the <em>week is organized</em>.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Each word names a real part of life at Saint Paul, and each colour follows you down the rest of this page. Welcome isn't a fourth word here — it's the room all three happen in.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="pillars">
      <article class="pillar p-1">
        <div class="num">Sundays</div>
        <h3>Inspiration</h3>
        <p>Blended worship, open communion, Bible study and prayer that send you back into Monday changed.</p>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <a class="more" href="#worship">Sunday worship</a>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar p-2">
        <div class="num">Midweek</div>
        <h3>Incarnation</h3>
        <p>Faith with skin on it — small groups, family care, music, and people who show up when life is hard.</p>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <a class="more" href="#ministries">Ministries &amp; groups</a>
      </article>
      <article class="pillar p-3">
        <div class="num">Fridays &amp; Saturdays</div>
        <h3>Intersection</h3>
        <p>Where church meets the neighborhood: dinner at the shelter every Friday, food, diapers, and advocacy.</p>
        <div class="rule"></div>
        <a class="more" href="#outreach">Out in the neighborhood</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== WORSHIP ========== -->
<section id="worship" class="tint reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Inspiration · Sunday worship</p>
      <h2>Come as you are, at <em>10:00 a.m.</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">Park anywhere in the lot on Peace Terrace, walk in, and someone will find you. Communion is served every Sunday at an open table.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid g3c" style="margin-bottom:2.4rem">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">1st, 2nd &amp; 3rd Sundays · 10 a.m.</span>
        <h3>Blended Worship</h3>
        <p>Traditional and contemporary elements woven together — hymns, choir, band, and a message for the week ahead.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">4th Sunday · 10 a.m.</span>
        <h3>Contemporary Worship</h3>
        <p>Led by the Praise Band, with a fuller set of modern worship music and a more informal feel.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">During the service</span>
        <h3>Childcare &amp; Kingdom Kidz</h3>
        <p>Childcare for infants and toddlers; Kingdom Kidz Sunday School meets in the Preschool Room for children through 6th grade.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem"><a class="btn btn-out" href="/kingdom-kidz/">Learn about Kingdom Kidz</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="grid g3c">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Sing and play with us</span>
        <h3>Music groups</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Agape</b> Choir ministry leading worship through the seasons</li>
          <li><b>Praise Band</b> Contemporary worship team</li>
          <li><b>Friends in Harmony</b> Ensemble for special services</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">2026 highlights</span>
        <h3>Seasons &amp; special Sundays</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Apr 2</b> Maundy Thursday — Family Foot Washing, 7 p.m.</li>
          <li><b>Apr 3</b> Good Friday Prayer Walk, 7 p.m.</li>
          <li><b>Apr 5</b> Easter Sunday — Contemporary Worship, 10 a.m.</li>
          <li><b>Nov 8</b> Church Anniversary Sunday</li>
          <li><b>Dec 22–23</b> Simbang Gabi, 6 p.m.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="contact">Vilma Antonio · <a href="tel:12098144047">(209) 814-4047</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Between Sundays</span>
        <h3>Prayer &amp; witness</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Prayer team</b> 1st Wednesday of the month, 10 a.m.</li>
          <li><b>Requests</b> Send a prayer request any time</li>
          <li><b>Witness</b> Evangelistic Sundays, May 17 &amp; 24, 10 a.m.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="contact">Carmela Cayanan &amp; Nina Bautista · Witness — Rommel Perez, <a href="tel:15104612408">(510) 461-2408</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== FIRST SUNDAY ========== -->
<section id="first" class="reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">New here?</p>
      <h2>What your <em>first Sunday</em> looks like</h2>
      <p class="lede">Dress however you're comfortable. Bring the kids — we're used to the noise. If you'd rather slip in at the back and just watch, that's a perfectly good way to start.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid g3c" style="margin-bottom:1.1rem">
      <article class="card card--accent">
        <span class="kicker">Before the service</span>
        <h3>Arrive around 9:50</h3>
        <p>Ten minutes gives you time for coffee and a hello before we begin. Someone at the door will point you to childcare, restrooms, and a seat.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--accent">
        <span class="kicker">Every Sunday</span>
        <h3>Communion is open</h3>
        <p>Come forward or stay seated — either is fine, and nobody is counting. Anyone who seeks to respond to Christ's love is invited.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--accent">
        <span class="kicker">Good to know</span>
        <h3>Language &amp; children</h3>
        <p>Services are in English. Our congregation is majority Filipino, with families from across the Bay Area's many communities. Childcare for infants and toddlers; Kingdom Kidz through 6th grade.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="grid g2c">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Since 1964</span>
        <h3>Who we are</h3>
        <p>Saint Paul UMC is a multi-cultural, multi-generational faith community called to make disciples of Jesus Christ for the transformation of the world. Roughly 250 people worship here each week, including 50–60 children.</p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:0">We are part of the California-Nevada Annual Conference of The United Methodist Church.</p>
        <p class="contact">Pastor — Rev. Rajiv Pathik, appointed July 2026 · Church office <a href="tel:15104293990">(510) 429-3990</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Three easy doors</span>
        <h3>Where to start</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Sunday</b> Worship at 10 a.m., then stay for coffee</li>
          <li><b>Midweek</b> Join a Bible study, or the Thursday line dancing class</li>
          <li><b>Serve</b> Come with us to Abode Shelter on a Friday afternoon</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="contact">Not sure which one? Email <a href="mailto:welcome@belongatstpaul.org">welcome@belongatstpaul.org</a> and we'll meet you at the door.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== WEEK AT ST PAUL ========== -->
<section id="week" class="tint reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">The rhythm</p>
      <h2>A week at <em>Saint Paul</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">Something is happening on this campus almost every day. Drop in on any of it — none of these require an invitation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger">
      <div class="day">
        <h3>Sunday</h3>
        <div class="slots">
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">9:00 a.m.</div><div class="d">Coram Deo Bible Study</div></div>
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">10:00 a.m.</div><div class="d">Worship · Kingdom Kidz Sunday School · SPY Bible Study</div></div>
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">1st Sunday</div><div class="d">Children's Worship, led by Kingdom Kidz</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day">
        <h3>Wednesday</h3>
        <div class="slots">
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">10:00 a.m.</div><div class="d">Prayer Ministry Team (first Wednesday of the month)</div></div>
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">7:00 p.m.</div><div class="d">Spiritual Lifers Bible Study</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day">
        <h3>Thursday</h3>
        <div class="slots">
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">10:30 a.m.</div><div class="d">Line dancing — Lighthouse Family Care Ministry</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day">
        <h3>Friday</h3>
        <div class="slots">
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">11:30 a.m.</div><div class="d">Friday Bible Study Group</div></div>
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">4:00 p.m.</div><div class="d">Serve dinner at Abode Shelter</div></div>
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">7:30 p.m.</div><div class="d">SP Youth (SPY) gathering, until about 9:30 p.m.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="day">
        <h3>Saturday</h3>
        <div class="slots">
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">1st Sat</div><div class="d">United Women in Faith Fellowship Study, 9:30 a.m.</div></div>
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">2nd Sat</div><div class="d">Sunshine Fellowship potluck breakfast, 9:00 a.m.</div></div>
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">3rd Sat</div><div class="d">Diaper Drive collection</div></div>
          <div class="slot"><div class="t">Last Sat</div><div class="d">United Methodist Men fellowship &amp; breakfast, 10:30 a.m.</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== UPCOMING (live Google Calendar) ========== -->
<section class="band reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Mark your calendar</p>
      <h2>What's ahead <em>this month</em></h2>
      <p class="lede" id="uphint">Everything coming up this month, from our shared church calendar.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="upcoming" id="upcoming"></ul>
    <div class="btnrow" style="justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:2rem">
      <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="/calendar/">See the full calendar</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?cid=welcome%40belongatstpaul.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Add to Google Calendar</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="webcal://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/welcome%40belongatstpaul.org/public/basic.ics">Subscribe (Apple &amp; Outlook)</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== MINISTRIES ========== -->
<section id="ministries" class="reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Incarnation · Find your people</p>
      <h2>Ministries &amp; small groups</h2>
      <p class="lede">Every one of these started because someone said yes. There is room for you in all of them, and no group here is closed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g3c">
      {%- for card in collections.ministry %}
      <article class="card acc-{{ card.data.accent }}"{% if card.data.anchor %} id="{{ card.data.anchor }}"{% endif %}>
        <span class="kicker">{{ card.data.kicker }}</span>
        <h3>{{ card.data.title }}</h3>
        {{ card.templateContent | safe }}
        {%- if card.data.contact %}
        <p class="contact">{{ card.data.contact | markdownInline | safe }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if card.data.cta_label and card.data.cta_url %}
        <p style="margin:.9rem 0 0"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="{{ card.data.cta_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ card.data.cta_label }}</a></p>
        {%- endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== OUTREACH ========== -->
<section id="outreach" class="tint reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Intersection · Out in the neighborhood</p>
      <h2>Outreach, mission &amp; justice</h2>
      <p class="lede">Where our story engages the world. Most of this needs nothing but your hands and an evening.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g3c">
      {%- for card in collections.outreach %}
      <article class="card acc-{{ card.data.accent }}">
        <span class="kicker">{{ card.data.kicker }}</span>
        <h3>{{ card.data.title }}</h3>
        {{ card.templateContent | safe }}
        {%- if card.data.contact %}
        <p class="contact">{{ card.data.contact | markdownInline | safe }}</p>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if card.data.cta_label and card.data.cta_url %}
        <p style="margin:.9rem 0 0"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="{{ card.data.cta_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ card.data.cta_label }}</a></p>
        {%- endif %}
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== KIDS & YOUTH ========== -->
<section id="kids" class="reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">Every age belongs here</p>
      <h2>Kingdom Kidz &amp; SP Youth</h2>
      <p class="lede">Fifty to sixty children are part of this church on a normal Sunday. They are not the future of Saint Paul — they're already the church, this morning.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid g2c">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Nursery through 6th grade</span>
        <h3>Kingdom Kidz — Children's Ministry</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Weekly</b> Sunday School, 10 a.m., Preschool Room</li>
          <li><b>1st Sun</b> Children's Worship, 10 a.m.</li>
          <li><b>Oct 18</b> Children's Sunday — the kids lead worship</li>
          <li><b>Dec 6</b> Christmas Parents &amp; Kids Fellowship, 10 a.m.</li>
          <li><b>Dec 23</b> Simbang Gabi with United Women in Faith</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="contact">Lynn Absalon · <a href="tel:13412498234">(341) 249-8234</a></p>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem"><a href="/kingdom-kidz/">More about Kingdom Kidz →</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Middle school &amp; high school</span>
        <h3>SPY — Saint Paul Youth</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Fridays</b> Youth gathering, 7:30–9:30 p.m.</li>
          <li><b>Sundays</b> Sunday School &amp; Bible study, 10 a.m.</li>
          <li><b>Ongoing</b> Confirmation class with Mark Bautista</li>
          <li><b>Dec 22</b> Simbang Gabi with United Methodist Men, 6 p.m.</li>
          <li><b>Dec 27–30</b> Christmas Institute</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="contact">Joy Madarang &amp; Mark Bautista · <a href="tel:15104293990">(510) 429-3990</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== PRESCHOOL ========== -->
<section id="preschool" class="band reveal">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sechead">
      <p class="eyebrow">A ministry of Saint Paul since 2001</p>
      <h2 style="color:#fff">Precious Time Christian Preschool</h2>
      <p class="lede">A multicultural, multi-ethnic preschool community for ages 2 to 6 — where play is taken seriously, because play is how children learn.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g3c">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Who we serve</span>
        <h3>Ages 2 to 6</h3>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">30+ years, collectively</span>
        <h3>Our teachers</h3>
        <p>Every teacher meets State licensing requirements and holds a Teacher Permit, A.A. or B.A. in Child Development, plus a current Pediatric CPR and First-Aid certificate.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Tours by appointment</span>
        <h3>Visit us</h3>
        <p class="contact"><a href="mailto:precioustimepreschool@gmail.com">precioustimepreschool@gmail.com</a></p>
        <p style="margin-top:.8rem"><a href="https://preschool.belongatstpaul.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more at our preschool site →</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);max-width:70ch">Children are taught the basic concepts of Christian belief and conduct without a denominational slant, in a safe and secure environment where guidance and discipline are just, loving and consistent.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="https://preschool.belongatstpaul.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit our preschool website</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

