    <div class="grid g3c">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Quarterly meetings, 2026</span>
        <h3>Core Team</h3>
        <ul><li><b>Apr 18</b> Quarterly meeting</li><li><b>Aug 1</b> Quarterly meeting</li><li><b>Oct 10</b> Quarterly meeting</li></ul>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">SPPRC</span>
        <h3>Staff Pastor Parish Relations</h3>
        <ul><li><b>Jun 28</b> Pastors Appreciation Sunday, 10 a.m.</li><li><b>Jul 5</b> Welcome event for our new pastor, Rev. Rajiv Pathik, 10 a.m.</li></ul>
        <p class="contact">Leonie Bernardo · <a href="tel:15103312353">(510) 331-2353</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="kicker">Income &amp; expenses printed in the bulletin, 1st Sunday</span>
        <h3>Finance</h3>
